{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"間が空いちゃってごめんなさい(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さし坂46のときの\n14：00頃の楽屋での会話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀「お腹すいた〜\n伊織ご飯食べた？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織「昨日の夜？食べたよ♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀「え？昨日じゃなくて今日の昼！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織「あ！昼ごはん？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀「そう！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織「ごはん粒？伊織ごはん粒はあんまり好きじゃない」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀「え？何言ってるの？！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織「ごはん粒は食べてない♪\nでもお菓子は食べたよ♪」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで伊織はごはん粒単体の話しだと\n思っちゃったんだろう(´=ω=｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織はたまにこういうことが\nあります(｡・o・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てると面白いヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！\nさし坂46！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48対抗紅白歌合戦に\n指原さんとのコラボで\n出演させていただきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さし坂メンバーは\n指原さん・美彩・飛鳥・琴子\n伊織・まいまい・未央奈・私の8人(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？を\n披露させていただいたんだけど\nいつもと衣装も違って\nなんと、なななんと\n乃木坂がミニスカートに\nなっちゃったんです(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これに(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覗いてるのはビー玉姉さん☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、パンツを見せながら\n踊ってるんじゃないかと\n不安になるくらいに短くて\nやっぱり膝丈は落ち着くなぁと\nしみじみ思いました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段私服では短い丈をよく履くけど\nやっぱり歌衣装だと違う感覚(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏はAKBグループの\nみなさんがたくさんいて\nかわいい〜(´°ω°｀)って何回\n言ったかわからないくらい言った♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メも撮ってもらったので\n載せちゃいまーす♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メまつりだ〜ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ\nわっしょいわっしょい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指原さん♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく優しく接してくださって\n緊張をほぐしてくれました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にステージに\n立てて嬉しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みるきーさん♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また撮ってもらっちゃった♪\nよくお互いのファンの方の\n話をしたりしますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こじまこちゃん♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755ではお話ししたこと\nあったけど直接話せてなかったので\nやっと会えて嬉しかった(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔癒されるーっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"向井地美音ちゃん♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前から雑誌とかを見て\nかわいい〜って思ってて、\n実際会ってもめっちゃ\n可愛かったです(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湯本亜美ちゃん♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈がお友達で\n写メ撮ってもいいですか？\nって言って来てくれたんです(^^)\nうれしい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと乃木坂メンバーの\n近くにいてくれたなこちゃん♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天使ってこの世に居たんだ！\nと本当に思うほどなこちゃんの\n笑顔に癒され過ぎてメンバーみんな\nもう虜になりました(〃°ω°〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一家に一人なこちゃん欲しい♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして勇気を振り絞って\nまゆゆさんとも撮ってもらいました♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凛としてるし\n可愛いのにかっこいい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくお忙しいのに\nよく乃木坂のライブにも来て\nくださってありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という感じでいろんな方と\nおしゃべりして来ました〜(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さし坂46に呼んでいただいて\nありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は少しさかのぼって、\nクリスマスライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタ帽ギリギリ入った..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有明コロシアムで3公演\n満員の客席を見て、\nカラフルなクリスマスの\nイルミネーションみたいな\nサイリウムを見て、\nすごく感動しました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもライブをすると\nみなさんに感動をたくさん\nいただいてしまいます(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブはショーという形\nだったのでクリスマスメドレーでは\n他のアーティストさんの歌も\n歌わせてもらって中でも\n私がどうしても歌いたいと\nリハのときずーーーっと懇願して\nいたのがSPEEDさんのWhite Love"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃から一番大好きな\nアーティストさんで、\n見よう見まねで歌って踊ったりも\nよくしてたんです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからひたすら歌いたいアピールを\nスタッフさんにしてました(OωO )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その願いが叶って雪が舞う中で\n歌うことが出来ました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってるときすっごく\n幸せだった〜(´°ω°｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして3公演とも全部に\nサプライズ発表がありました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・乃木どこDVD発売\n・3rdバースデーライブin西武ドーム\n・DOCUMENTARY of 乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2/22の西武ドームは\n極寒すぎるくらい\n極寒らしいんだけど\n乃木坂ファンのみなさんと\n乃木坂メンバーでその寒さを\n吹っ飛ばしましょ〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はただただ寒さに人一倍弱い\n玲香ちゃんが心配です(*´･ω･`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！玲香といえば、\n昨日発売のヤングガンガンに\n玲香と2人で表紙をさせて\nいただいてます(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"壁を見て笑う私"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもお風呂に貼れる\nポスターもついてるの...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族と住んでる方はこっそり\n自分が入るときだけ貼ってね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も今日探してこよーっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひチェックして見てください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうひとつ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たち乃木坂46が2015年の\n日本郵便の年賀状親善大使を\n務めさせていただくことに\nなりました∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"住所がわからなくても\n年賀状が送れちゃう便利な\n時代でございます(OωO )すごい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年末の風物詩に年賀状\n送りましよ〜ヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また長いブログになっちゃったけど\n最後まで読んでくれてありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もあと少し！\n寒さも増してきたから\n風邪引かないように\n気をつけてね(*´･ｖ･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、引いちゃったら看病しにいくから\n真夏診療所までお電話を〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の日本有線大賞観てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/12/20/6939239/0020.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大和が乃木坂を旅立つことになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に活動してきた仲間がまた一人居なくなるのは寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別々の道を歩むことになるけれど、大和は大和なりの道で元気に過ごせることを祈ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またどこかで会った時、お互い笑顔で出会えますように...☆"}],"source":"archive"}